Subject: [CANDIDATE] usb: musb: return DMA ownership after failed restart allocation

The restart callback is not called if deferred-work allocation fails.
Return the still-owned request mapping before reporting queue failure.
Keep success paths free of post-callback request access.

Not in the active image patch queue; see the candidate regression task.

--- a/drivers/usb/musb/musb_gadget.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/musb/musb_gadget.c
@@ -1308,6 +1308,7 @@
 					__func__, status);
 				list_del(&request->list);
 				musb_ep->restart_pending = false;
+				unmap_dma_buffer(request, musb);
 			}
 		}
 	}
